- dttransport and VirtIO-DTrace guest modules: component build PASS.
- bhyve with snapshots enabled and libvmmapi: component build PASS (build9.log).
- native-port-round4: six ASan/UBSan suites PASS, covering CPUID discovery,
  bounded ELF fragments, bhyve sockets, actual device callbacks/worker,
  actual page walkers/guest string helpers, and actual map/provider functions.
- probe-ioctl: actual ioctl case and lock helper tests PASS with ASan/UBSan.
- native-daemon-round4: native daemon sanitized build/link plus job-lifetime,
  framing/deadline and event-retirement suites PASS. No daemon was started.
- control-client socketpair frame/bounds/NAK test and dtracedctl build PASS.
- Kernel DTrace and HyperTrace modules rebuilt successfully after the lifetime
