2026-10-13: bhyve connector completion

The bhyve HyperTrace forwarder also used a nonblocking Unix socket, but
treated EINPROGRESS from connectat as failure. It now shares the bounded
poll/SO_ERROR completion routine with dtraced, and uses one two-second
deadline for connection completion and the initial handshake. A native test
forces connectat to report EINPROGRESS after a real local connection and
checks the complete daemon hello exchange. native-port-round27.log passes
twenty-five ASan/UBSan suites; native-daemon-round38.log passes fourteen.
